# Hand the terminal to $EDITOR and take it back. The stand-in editor appends a line,
# so the note the item did not have appears, and the screen is whole afterward.
mask /Created: [A-Z][a-z]+ \d+, \d{4}/ "Created: <date>"

wait Export posts from the old CMS
press l
wait c complete
press ]
wait /> [▸▾] ✓ Pick a theme/

press e
wait /Pick a theme ≡/
frame note-saved
press space
wait Written from the editor.
frame note-in-place
press space
gone Written from the editor.
press q
exits
